{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845630/extras/68fd877c5cf0047d5a136e5217583104.poster.avif?t=1764989968\" width=616 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845630/extras/68fd877c5cf0047d5a136e5217583104.webm?t=1764989968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845630/extras/68fd877c5cf0047d5a136e5217583104.mp4?t=1764989968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845630/extras/07af18d2b47317c623cd0bccf66130f1.avif?t=1764989968\" width=616 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mari, a quiet and anxious girl, sets out to find some limited-edition slime merchandise but ends up at a small wellness center by mistake. The receptionist, Dana, is a bit unusual but kind, and suggests Mari try a stress-relief session instead. Unsure but curious, Mari agrees. Now it's up to you to help her relax and feel a little lighter. Will she find some relief through your touch or will you scare her away? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the right spots on her body, and you might just see her return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845630/extras/1ce7a3f2af781d420dcec12995776754.avif?t=1764989968\" width=616 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of a massage therapist helping Mari manage stress and rebuild her confidence. Touch, rub, and pull the right spots at the right time for her pleasure. Let your hands explore every part of her body. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ease her tension, gain her trust... and she might open herself completely, in ways you won\u2019t forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845630/extras/11548d9e68d07a4bd76abd1c3e8201b4.poster.avif?t=1764989968\" width=616 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845630/extras/11548d9e68d07a4bd76abd1c3e8201b4.webm?t=1764989968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845630/extras/90d409ac5aa8dc93dc04895e86ba6502.avif?t=1764989968\" width=616 height=124 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Animated Scenes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game offers smooth and natural animations of every interaction durring each massage session. Every touch, rub and poke is animated!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Touchy Feely</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a masseur, it's your job to rub your hands all over Mari's body.  If you're confident with your techniques and gained enough of her trust, you can even try to use more than your hands! Raising her self-esteem unlocks more interactions. Just take it slow and you'll do fine.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mood Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay attention to her mood and make sure she's happy with your service. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speak at the wrong moment, or move into more intimate touch before she\u2019s ready, and she won\u2019t be back for another session!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deeper Relationship and Multiple Endings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through each session, you can unlock more of the story between you and Mari. The choices you make throughout the game will determine which ending you get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3845630?t=1764989968","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845630/41954475d006c2a13ef402710cebc2e088c1c78a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764989968","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845630/c5494c422b7bc6ed8e46bf5910eaf4315488eb80/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764989968","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845630/c5494c422b7bc6ed8e46bf5910eaf4315488eb80/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764989968","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"The game contains nudity and explicit depictions of sexual acts between adults such as sex during sleep and sleep assault. Drugs like alcohol are also present during the story and gameplay."},"demos":[{"appid":4016340,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845630/extras/68fd877c5cf0047d5a136e5217583104.poster.avif?t=1764989968\" width=616 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845630/extras/68fd877c5cf0047d5a136e5217583104.webm?t=1764989968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845630/extras/68fd877c5cf0047d5a